-- modkit test turret: the stock `kus_assaultgun` turret (its model, shared), armed with `test_turret`, for
-- `test engine/lead/turret`. Its name needs a race prefix (`TEST_`, modkit's test race: `scripts/races/test.lua`): a turret subsystem whose name has none is created
-- without its weapon (it never fires, and the UI shows 0 attack damage; found 2026-11-08). Not for gameplay.

NewSubSystemType = StartSubSystemConfig()
NewSubSystemType.selectionLimit=1
NewSubSystemType.type="Weapon"
NewSubSystemType.hasIcon=0
LoadSharedModel(NewSubSystemType,"Kus_AssaultGun"); 
NewSubSystemType.AttackFamily="Frigate"
NewSubSystemType.ArmourFamily="MediumArmour"
StartSubSystemWeaponConfig(NewSubSystemType,"test_turret","Weapon_Gun0","Weapon_Gun0");
